    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on wolfram2002-ch05-21: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.57";
    dc:description "Large finite catalogs permit informative comparisons after substantial interpretation. The broad “almost all” conclusion is representation-dependent and cannot be settled across unspecified formalisms.";
